rding the function $y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=cos⁡x.$\n\n![](images/9c/9c77bec4ebb04668fbff5176418ed9c09143a8660879fdf523a158c5f109006c.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement “The function intersects the $x$-axis at $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}.$” is true. At $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}$ the function intersects the $x$-axis.\n\n- Statement “The function has a minimum value at  $x=2\\pi .$” is false. The function has a maximum at $x=2\\pi .$\n\n- Statement “The function intersects the $y$-axis at $y=0.$” is false. The function intersects the $y$-axis at $y=1.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338799 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b7fc3c01-7f3a-5c6b-abd7-c743ce206e9b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438490} {:answer/id #uuid "47099553-c6c1-5bd1-9e0e-9f21c98fc65f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438491}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b7fc3c01-7f3a-5c6b-abd7-c743ce206e9b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438490} :answer-field/id #uuid "a81ed0d9-7e42-5cbb-aca1-b03bc48b3022" :answer-field/key "The function has maximum values at $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+2n\\pi .$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439274} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "46870e8a-9f05-53d2-a4ea-6c68291e1467" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438492} {:answer/id #uuid "71ec84ae-38af-5df8-81fd-d23b40330600" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438493}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "71ec84ae-38af-5df8-81fd-d23b40330600" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438493} :answer-field/id #uuid "faf0da50-2691-505e-8eef-7d1db6e3c6e2" :answer-field/key "The function is zero at $x=-\\frac{\\pi }{2}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439275} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "550bb9f1-5049-57d7-84d3-41f3f2ac8184" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438494} {:answer/id #uuid "a91fa62b-3e27-5516-b774-e6cf906a51d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438495}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "550bb9f1-5049-57d7-84d3-41f3f2ac8184" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438494} :answer-field/id #uuid "a5214bf9-b022-5d37-a8e8-c3abbfca85a8" :answer-field/key "The range of the function is $[-\\pi ,\\pi ].$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439276}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f5773d37-2017-53ae-a0d1-64c772d0dcaf" :question/math-academy-id "q-70666" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=cos⁡x?$ Assume that $n$ is an integer.\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=cos⁡x.$\n\n![](images/88/88378ece5b1721cdc533d07d69c004901539c7f8fda9a5a3e5c5648ed32905c5.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement “The function has maximum values at $x=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+2n\\pi .$” is false. The function has a maximum at $x=0,\\pm 2\\pi ,…,$ which can be written as $x=2n\\pi .$\n\n- Statement “The function is zero at $x=-\\frac{\\pi }{2}.$” is true. At $x=-\\frac{\\pi }{2}$, the function intersects the $x$-axis.\n\n- Statement “The range of the function is $[-\\pi ,\\pi ].$” is false. The minimum value is $-1$, the maximum value is $1$, and so the range is $[-1,1].$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186338800 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "991d9c5f-a832-550c-b